OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe deliberate fire at
OL,4,AGlasgow city centre bar
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a deliberate
OL,7,Ffire at a bar in the centre of Glasgow.
OL,9,FMore than 40 firefighters were called
OL,10,Fto the blaze just after 14:40 on Sunday
OL,11,Fand nine appliances were in attendance
OL,12,Flater that evening.
OL,14,FImages from the scene showed parts of
OL,15,FRenfield Street and West Regent Street
OL,16,Fcordoned off, with a number of fire
OL,17,Fcrews gathered outside both the Bistro
OL,18,Fand Maltman bars.
OL,20,FFire crews have now left the scene.
OL,21,FThere were no reports of any
OL,22,Fcasualties.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
